Z||000000||Voyd||12-16-1999||11:35 AM||||to any Canadians, is there anywhere to get Fiero parts (mainly body panels) in Canada? anyone know an individual or a company who is located in Canada and can ship stuff? or anyone reading this from Canada and have spare parts? the shipping rates from the USA to here are just downright scary. i need a few body panels and to be frank id rather not  get them at all if im going to have to pay 50% of the price in shipping just becuase it crosses some dumb border.<P>thanks!||||reg||5
