Z||000013||batboy||12-17-1999||11:58 PM||||Our star Topeka hockey player is from B.C. and I've been to Vancouver once before (nice town and cute ladies), so I know where B.C. is and that it's a province of Canada. But, I've met Americans that didn't even know that Kansas was one of our 50 states. Geography is not a strong point of a lot of Americans, I guess.<P>Trivia question: What is the northern most U.S. state, not counting Alaska? To make this Fiero related, this state does have a Fiero club too.||||reg||1
